🔥 The 80/20 Aptitude Strategy I recommend for you

Don't try to study 30–40 aptitude topics equally.

Tier 1 — MUST MASTER

These are the topics I would want you to become very strong in first:

Priority	Topic	Important concepts you must know
🔥 1	Percentage	                increase/decrease, successive %, percentage of percentage, fraction ↔ %, comparison
🔥 2	Ratio & Proportion	        basic ratio, equivalent ratio, division, proportion, direct/inverse proportion
🔥 3	Profit, Loss & Discount	    CP, SP, profit%, loss%, discount, marked price, successive discounts
🔥 4	Time, Speed & Distance	    D = S × T, relative speed, average speed, trains, boats & streams
🔥 5	Time & Work	                efficiency, work/day, combined work, men-days, pipes & cisterns
🔥 6	Averages	                  basic average, weighted average, replacement problems
🔥 7	Number System	              divisibility, HCF, LCM, remainders, unit digit, number properties
🔥 8	Simple & Compound Interest	SI, CI, rate, principal, amount, SI-CI difference
🔥 9	Data Interpretation	        tables, bar graphs, pie charts, percentage calculations
🔥 10	Mixtures & Alligation	      mixture ratio, replacement, alligation
